{"repositoryId":1405954863,"availability":"available","full":"ibisjp/ibis-office","name":"ibis-office","description":"The next-gen Office suite built with Rust & GPUI. Blazing-fast, memory-safe, and highly accurate editing for DOCX, XLSX, and PPTX with pixel-perfect rendering. Powered by DirectX, Metal, Vulkan & WebGPU for peak performance across Windows, macOS, Linux, and Web (Wasm).","category":"Design","language":"Rust","stars":243,"forks":11,"created":"2026-10-05T15:07:34Z","updated":"2026-10-12T11:56:23Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ibisjp.github.io/ibis-office/","topics":["docx","gpui","office","office-suite","pptx","rust","webassembly","webgpu","xlsx"],"demo":"https://ibisjp.github.io/ibis-office/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.099Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.099Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.099Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.099Z","stars":243,"forks":11}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The next-generation office suite, built with Rust and the GPU, that opens your documents exactly as Microsoft Office shows them.","Word (.docx), Excel (.xlsx) and PowerPoint (.pptx) — fast, accurate, everywhere.","ibisOffice is an office suite for viewing, editing and saving Word, Excel and PowerPoint documents. It is written entirely in Rust and draws everything on the GPU. The same single codebase runs as a desktop app on macOS and Windows and in the web browser."],"features":["Documents (.docx): paragraphs and styles, bullets and numbering, tables, columns, vertical text, ruby, footnotes, headers and footers, fields (page numbers, tables of contents), shapes, images and charts, page setup.","Spreadsheets (.xlsx): formulas and functions, conditional formatting, AutoFilter, sorting, tables, PivotTables, charts, sparklines, data validation, sheet protection, rich text within a cell, Goal Seek.","Presentations (.pptx): viewing and editing shapes, text, tables, charts and SmartArt; animations, transitions, slide shows and Presenter View (with dual-display support), video and audio, comments.","Macro-enabled files (.docm, .xlsm, .pptm) open and save too. Macros are never run; they are kept as they are.","We verify visual compatibility by measurement. For each feature we build test documents and compare, pixel by pixel, the PDF that real Word, Excel and PowerPoint produce with what ibisOffice draws. Files saved by…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ibisjp/ibis-office/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6055754f1bf654cffe28d37801dee439cadd0a4a1141c4527addddb2f58146ae","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:07.069Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:07.069Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The next-generation office suite, built with Rust and the GPU, that opens your documents exactly as Microsoft Office shows them.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ibisjp/ibis-office/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"6055754f1bf654cffe28d37801dee439cadd0a4a1141c4527addddb2f58146ae","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ibisjp/ibis-office/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:07.070Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T11:56:23Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ibisjp/ibis-office/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:07.072Z","hash":"6055754f1bf654cffe28d37801dee439cadd0a4a1141c4527addddb2f58146ae","originalBytes":80433,"storedBytes":80433,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["completed","xlsx","docx","pptx","partial","text","field","page","table","data","cell","slide","chart","formatting","color","line","show","column","insert","cells","ibisoffice","row","charts","office","save","columns","number","open","styles","view","axis","date","document","paragraph","vertical","custom","fields","picture","rows","size","edit","effects","start","alignment","etc.","fill","functions","width","display","font","he